  displayName: Elephant
  habitat: Open country and grasslands. See them in Amboseli National Park.
  status: Endangered (IUCN Red List, savanna elephant)
  fact: African savanna elephant numbers fell by at least 60% over the last 50 years,
    according to the IUCN. Poaching and habitat loss are the main threats.
  viewingTip: Never block an elephant's path or step between a mother and her calf.
  warningLine: Ears out and trunk up. Back off now.
